  "role": "Missile Boat",
  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Draconis Combine Mustered Soldiery assigns conventional infantry to garrison roles across its military districts, with district regulars often fielding extra platoons to secure worlds that BattleMech forces cannot permanently garrison. The platoon operates a Sniper Cannon, a direct-fire variant of the Sniper artillery piece. It gives up the ability to lob shells over obstacles in exchange for the accuracy and responsiveness needed to engage targets the crew can actually see.</p>"
